                                                "sense_id": "2674320e-b8f6-382b-946d-454b24321812",
                                                "text": "And maybe the Moravecian dream would be especially exciting for fans of guro manga who want to live out all the fantasies to have sex like the immortal Mai in Waita Uziga's Mai-chan's Daily Life, who stay alive even after being violently mutilated […]"
